    "description": "Patrol & Community Activities module.\n\nBase URL: {{base_url}}\nSemua request butuh Bearer token (set variable `token`).\nSemua mutasi (POST) wajib header `Idempotency-Key` (8-128 karakter [A-Za-z0-9._:-]).\nMutasi yang mengubah versi resource wajib sertakan field `version` dari response terakhir; mismatch -> 409.",
